	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"• 最新TVシリーズ第4期仕様の主役機アーバレストが1/60スケールでついにキット化！",
			"• 股関節ブロックにスライド式関節を採用し、膝立ちや劇中の激しいアクションシーンなどのポージングも再現が可能。",
			"• お馴染みの武装をはじめとする多くの武装パーツが付属。",
			"• 頭部は選択式でナイフ咥えを再現できるほか、同時発売のガーンズバックの武装も装備可能でプレイバリュー満載。",
			"• 劇中で印象的な「ラムダ・ドライバ」は差替えで発動状態を再現可能。広い可動域と合わせて劇中の戦闘シーンを再現できる。",
			"• メカデザイナー海老川兼武氏がデザインを手がけたプラモデルオリジナルウェポン「グラーツ・マンリッヒャー AWS2000 LDWタイプ」が付属する。"
		],
		"en": [
			"• Arbalest, the main character from the latest TV series season 4 specification, is finally available as a kit in 1/60 scale!",
			"• A sliding joint is used for the hip joint block, allowing you to recreate poses such as kneeling or intense action scenes from the movie.",
			"• Includes many armed parts including familiar weapons.",
			"• The head can be selected to reproduce the knife in its mouth, and it can also be equipped with Gernsback's armament that will be released at the same time, making it packed with play value.",
			"• The impressive \"lambda driver\" in the play can be replaced to recreate its activated state. With a wide range of motion, you can recreate battle scenes from the movie.",
			"• Comes with an original plastic model weapon \"Graz Mannlicher AWS2000 LDW type\" designed by mechanical designer Kanetake Ebikawa."
		]
	},
